message: "If you use this code, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "Real-Time Activity Recognition via Wearable Sensors: subject-independent evaluation and causal streaming inference"
authors:
  - family-names: "Ghosh"
    given-names: "Aranya"
repository-code: "https://github.com/Aranya2801/Real-Time-Activity-Recognition-via-Wearable-Sensors"
url: "https://aranyaghosh.org"
abstract: >-
  Code and experiments for human activity recognition from smartphone IMU
  data, evaluated with leave-subjects-out cross-validation on MotionSense,
  with a causal streaming pipeline (ring buffer + HMM smoothing) and ONNX
  export for on-device inference.
keywords:
  - human-activity-recognition
  - wearable-sensors
  - time-series-classification
  - streaming-inference
license: MIT
